msgid "Only SELECT queries are allowed. INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, DROP, TRUNCATE, CREATE, ALTER, EXPLAIN, DESCRIBE, and UNION are not permitted."
msgstr "Dozwolone są tylko zapytania SELECT. Zapytania INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, DROP, TRUNCATE, CREATE, ALTER, EXPLAIN, DESCRIBE i UNION nie są dozwolone."

